 "observations": [
  "The page number «255» stands at the head of the page, centred, with a rule below it. The page has no signature. The last page of the index and of the book. Two columns divided by a vertical rule, which ends with the last lines; transcribed column by column: the left column L01-L21, the right L22-L45; the letter heads «V.» (L13), «W.» (L22), «Y.» (L26) and «Z.» (L34) in bold, centred in their columns, «V.» after a wide space, «W.» at the head of the right column, «Y.» and «Z.» after a narrower space than on the other pages; each entry begins at the edge of its column, its further lines indented, the subentries with a dash indented less. Below the columns a short centred double rule ends the index; the rest of the page is blank.",
  "The semicolons of L07, L20, L40 and L45 stand after a thin space (10-11 px); written with a space. L15: «86‐‐90» is printed with two short dashes (14 and 16 px with a gap of 2 px), here written as two hyphens (U+2010), as on p. 242 (JP2 0276); the other dashes are long (28-47 px). L27: a speck above the space between «Yaḥyā» and «b.»; not transcribed. L32: «Ysidorus» stands between «Yezdegird» and «Yojana», out of the alphabetical order of the index.",
  "Checked against the text, for example: «Ujjayinī» on p. 33 (JP2 0065), «Ulūgh Beg» on p. 78, the shadows on pp. 20-22 and in Tab. 60 (p. 174), «mankūs» on pp. 69 and 77, «mustewia» on p. 21, the years of nativity on p. 103 and in Tab. 115 (p. 230, JP2 0262), the years of the world on p. 103, «Varāha» on pp. 46 and 235, «Vollmond» on p. 84, «Washington» on p. 52, «Wüstenfeld» on p. XIII, «Yaḥyā b. Abī Manṣūr» on p. 32, «Yaʿḳūb b. Ṭāriḳ» on pp. 32 and 70, Yezdegird on pp. VII, VIII, XV, 33, 35, 37 and 106, «Ysidorus» on p. XVII, «Yojana» on p. 91, «al-Zarḳālī» on p. 236, the mean and true time and the equation of time on p. 80, with Tab. 67-68 (pp. 181-182), «Zenitdistanz» on p. 92, «Zeuthen» on pp. VII, 68 and 71, «Zodiacus» on p. 29."
 ],
 "copy_matter": [
  "The round stamp of the Wellcome Institute library («WELLCOME» above, «LIBRARY» across the middle, «INSTITUTE» below), below the right column at the right, beside the end rule."
 ],
